{"summary":"This will quickly become your kids' favorite animals game!","description":"If your child loves visiting the zoo, they will love Intellijoy's latest app, Kids Learn about Animals.  In fact, once they are done playing Kids Learn about Animals, your children will know more about animals than you do - guaranteed.  With its HD graphics, vivid animal sounds and lively voiceover, Kids Learn about Animals will quickly become your kids' favorite animals game.\n\nKids Learn about Animals contains over 90 questions and educational descriptions for more than 70 animals.  The game is divided into four different \"zones\":  Farm and Domestic, Forest Wildlife, Africa Wildlife, as well as North and South Pole.  It is intended for children ages 3 to 9.\n\nUpdate: Now your kids can hear a likeable teacher talk about each animal.  To support this new voiceover functionality, two new permissions were added:  \"Modify SD card contents\", \"Full Internet Access'.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hv5DHgpa_KE?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bpvkO439EO5ceieGTjveWcm2VQEIor_HB0-PhJKh3MBbMrJnYBCXkfL9gpkPx1bHesijL0ncGTBcLpnfzC9aDQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DYYevl1emkt72v6eRzaTj8Lh6AQnDsInh5yUWwS2MBk-LffqbNAPvtQiBmh3M6akRrTcAPrduVfx4kSudORwWw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lwf7XrsZYrWlkoJSCwOnr0wtkidE-YLwx3vhF3DUjP1iJH7cFdpXB4N2DnqM5HAv-RuViqLH_eJEeNn_7mhgAg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZZBB2CGVsfLzMsCr6Rb0fcZv69AZhgAQofwgZZsPAHV-VawqYIykezqEx508nw8s_SKnl6zMq8nXVdJOcOyMSA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Aa4al1eCOna2IpD0a161eFBlzpeEoqFkrRCtrxaFNVRacBWPY13U0jDhB8Lhizbl7118tCa_3WS86t72gs-EKA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_sODdh0HC3yDFs2Cnc-GmeqmtVfOH0KPzwHgauXsB1kQ1K1F7FlWGP0VFwyQ1IwJrmi1FW9uMnQnVr5OTtdgjC8","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/duZ7oCnm7vj-q_t2Clg6hMocNu929HYiiJotfudE5fv5nriCZLd3uy_GLTBu0zIzS